# nlprule binaries
Download from: https://github.com/bminixhofer/nlprule/releases/tag/0.6.4

Required files:
- en_tokenizer.bin (11 MB)
- en_rules.bin (7.2 MB)

Download commands:
curl -sL "https://github.com/bminixhofer/nlprule/releases/download/0.6.4/en_tokenizer.bin.gz" | gunzip > en_tokenizer.bin
curl -sL "https://github.com/bminixhofer/nlprule/releases/download/0.6.4/en_rules.bin.gz" | gunzip > en_rules.bin
